{"id":"bonus","lemma":"bonus","pos":"noun","rank":3970,"glosses":["premium","bonus"],"ipa":"/bɔ.nys/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/44/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-bonus.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-bonus.wav.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"J'ai reçu mon bonus.","en":"I received my bonus.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"J'ai été déçu de voir que mon bonus était un peu inférieur à ce que j'espérais.","en":"I was disappointed to see that my bonus was a bit less than I was expecting.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"disappointed"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"lower, under"},{"g":"to / at"},null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"espérer"}],"phrases":[[10,12,"a little, a bit"],[14,16,"what"]]},{"text":"Mon bonus ne permet même pas de couvrir tous les paiements d'emprunts que je dois effectuer.","en":"My bonus doesn't come close to covering all the loan payments I have to make.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to permit, to allow","l":"permettre"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to cover up, to cover"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"payment","l":"paiement"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"loan","l":"emprunt"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to effect"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"no, not even!"]]}]}